/discussion/ai-cohost/concept/startled-expression/*
!/discussion/ai-cohost/concept/startled-expression/README.md
/discussion/ai-cohost/concept/wry-smile-expression/*
!/discussion/ai-cohost/concept/wry-smile-expression/README.md

